@title Build mode: a problem with a photo from the camera or gallery
@area Cabinet
# Reports > Build mode > Problem… > Add photos…: the picture is kept on the punch item that the problem raises.
# The native file dialog is answered by the harness.
open qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo
wait 20
click_text Reports
wait 5
click_text "Build mode..."
wait 30
expect "Build mode"
click_text "Problem…" Button
wait 10
expect "What is wrong?"
expect "Add photos"
shot editor
check_layout
text Hole is off by 3 mm
wait 5
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/loose-terminal.png
click_text "Add photos…" Button
wait 10
expect "1 photo will be kept"
shot photo-chosen
check_layout
click_text "Raise problem" Button
wait 10
expect "1 problem"
shot raised
check_layout
